# Network Configuration

## Overview

The network is segmented using pfSense and VLANs to separate:

- management traffic
- lab environments
- service workloads

## WAN

- Upstream: ISP gateway
- Addressing: DHCP from upstream provider

## LAN

- Private subnet (RFC1918 addressing)
- pfSense acts as default gateway

## VLAN Design (Planned)

- Management VLAN
- Lab VLAN
- Services VLAN

## Notes

- Exact IP ranges, credentials, and device-specific configurations are intentionally excluded.
- This documentation reflects structure and design, not sensitive operational details.
